\title{Alternative proof of irreducible #{\Rightarrow} transitive}
\taxon{Remark}
\date{2023-10-01}
\author{JB00}
\import{macros}

\p{By \ref{GA18} there exists a #{K}-isomorphism #{K(\alpha_i) \cong K(\alpha_j)}, #{\alpha_i \mapsto \alpha_j}. This extends to an automorphism of #{L} by uniqueness of splitting fields.}
